# Per-developer Claude Code settings — local tool permissions and machine paths.
#
# This entry is deliberately the single file and NOT the .claude/ directory.
# 16 files under .claude/ are tracked on purpose: agents/, hooks/, skills/,
# settings.json and launch.json are shared project tooling. Ignoring the
# directory would not untrack those, but it WOULD hide newly added ones from
# git status, so a teammate's new skill or hook would silently never be
# committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
